url: https://github.com/javi2481/claimprint
abstract: >-
  Claimprint is a claims intelligence kernel: typed claims (identity, value,
  provenance) are extracted and verified before an answer is emitted. RAG chat
  is optional and consumes injected IDP claims; it is not the source of truth.
  This repository ships the first instance — finance over BYMA statements.
keywords:
